                        "glosses": [
                            "The skills needed to survive in the bush, and by extension in any natural environment."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a2865a3d-0dbb-49e1-ad3c-78e35b51aeec",
                                "sense_id": "e7abe9bc-f46d-375a-8713-471ad324bfeb",
                                "text": "Meronyms: camping, firemaking, hunting, fishing, trapping, gathering, first aid, orienteering"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4da24616-94cc-47ad-93dd-77cda4f3268f",
                                "sense_id": "e7abe9bc-f46d-375a-8713-471ad324bfeb",
                                "text": "Near-synonym: bushmanship"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4481d567-1928-44a7-ae0e-c591d2458f2d",
                                "sense_id": "e7abe9bc-f46d-375a-8713-471ad324bfeb",
                                "text": "The two activities (bushcraft and camping) have remarkable similarities because they are both outdoor activities that occur in distant territories. Camping is what everybody can participate in regardless of their abilities to survive. On the other hand, bushcraft requires a learned skillset and some amount of experience to thrive."
